{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #fcf0e7; box-sizing: border-box; color: #533d3d; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 26px 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #533d3d; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(180deg,#dba096 0,#edc7b2 42%,#fcf0e7 100%); border: 0; border-radius: 90px 90px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 26px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 58px 20px 28px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #533d3d; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e像傍晚天边漫开的一抹蜜桃橘粉，把整篇文章烘得暖融融的，读起来格外安心松弛。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 34px auto 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 18px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #9f4e46; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e落日蜜桃色的温柔开场\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #533d3d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e饱满柔和的暖蜜桃满幅开场卡一秒建立亲近感，正文回归干净暖白，文字清晰有温度。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #533d3d; font-size: 21px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.9; margin: 24px 0; padding: 24px 16px; text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e所有温柔以待的瞬间，都会在未来的某天悄悄回馈给你。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/artisan-bakery.jpg\" alt=\"暖光石桌上的法式牛角包与冰拿铁\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #efd9ce; border: 0; border-radius: 0 40px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 34px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 24px 18px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #9f4e46; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e暖调生活模板的适用场景\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e情感心理、自我成长与疗愈电台\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e烘焙美食、周末好去处与暖心笔记\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e温柔高辨识暖橘粉，不与深红撞色\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #84615a; color: #533d3d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e愿你今天也被温柔的晚风好好接住。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
